# Kite Weather
#
# Walking alone down a right-of-way beneath the power lines.
#
# Chords only, and the chords ARE the piece: nothing plays a tune. Three
# voices — low, middle, top — enter one after another inside each bar, so
# every chord unfolds from the bottom up; long attacks and releases let one
# chord dissolve into the next; each voice has its own phrase-long swells
# and filter arcs, so the harmony breathes in four-bar phrases rather than
# pulsing bar by bar. The drums set the pace of the walk and the chords
# pump against them, deeper as the walk goes on.
#
# The harmony sits on a low E that never leaves: Em9, Cmaj7#11, Am9, Bm11,
# the voices moving by step and common tone. Overhead the lines buzz on E,
# and the wind singing in the wires is tuned — each chord's notes, gusting.
#
#   bars 1-4    the low voice alone, a few sparks, the lines, the wires
#   bars 5-12   the walk: the chopped break, the middle voice, then the top;
#               the chord starts to run as a blooming stream
#   bars 13-15  under the line: the top drops out, the middle goes dark and
#               resonant, the wires sing loudest, the lines swell
#   bar 16      only the wires singing
#   bars 17-24  the walk again, everything open, the longest crescendo
#   bars 25-28  walking away: the voices leave from the top down
#
# Build the sounds first: python scripts/kite-weather-kit.py (renders/kite-kit/).
# 4/4 at 76 bpm; bar n starts at beat 4*(n-1).

bpm 76
gate 0.97
tail 5

automate tape_wow
0.05
automate tape_flutter
0.02
automate tape_age
0.3
automate tape_drive
0.35
automate chorus_mode
2
automate chorus_rate
0.35
automate chorus_depth
0.3
automate chorus_hiss
0.3
automate spring
0
automate reverb_wet
0.3
automate reverb_decay
0.86
automate reverb_tone
3200
automate width
1.2
automate comp_in
1
automate comp_threshold
-22
automate comp_ratio
1
automate comp_attack
3
automate comp_release
4
automate comp_makeup
2
automate comp_mix
0.45
automate fuzz
0
# the chorus is a send: the chords go through it, the drums stay dry
automate chorus_mix
0

# --- the low voice: roots and fifths, first in, last out
track low vel=0.55 patch=kaini chorus_send=0.5 reverb_send=0.3 pan=0 duck=0.01 duck_release=0.35
[E3 B3]:4 [C3 G3]:4 [A2 E3]:4 [B2 F#3]:4 [E3 B3]:4 [C3 G3]:4 [A2 E3]:4 [B2 F#3]:4 [E3 B3]:4 [C3 G3]:4 [A2 E3]:4 [B2 F#3]:4 [E3 B3]:4 [C3 G3]:4 [A2 E3]:4 R:4 [E3 B3]:4 [C3 G3]:4 [A2 E3]:4 [B2 F#3]:4 [E3 B3]:4 [C3 G3]:4 [A2 E3]:4 [B2 F#3]:4 [E3 B3]:4 [C3 G3]:4 [A2 E3]:4 [B2 F#3]:4
