R:16 E2:4@0.7 C2:4@0.7 A1:4@0.7 B1:4@0.7 E2:4@0.7 C2:4@0.7 A1:4@0.7 B1:4@0.7 E2:4@0.7 C2:4@0.7 A1:4@0.7 R:4 E2:4@0.7 C2:4@0.7 A1:4@0.7 B1:4@0.7 E2:4@0.7 C2:4@0.7 A1:4@0.7 B1:4@0.7 E2:4@0.7 C2:4@0.7 A1:4@0.7 B1:4@0.7
